OL,3,GNEWSATown gets first new almshouse in
OL,4,A160 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA small town with a long history of
OL,7,Foffering charitable accommodation to
OL,8,Fresidents has opened its first new
OL,9,Falmshouse in 160 years.
OL,11,FAlmshouses have stood in Winchcombe,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, since 1573, when the
OL,13,FChandos family of Sudeley Castle
OL,14,Fendowed them.
OL,16,FThe new site - run by the Chandos and
OL,17,FDent's Almshouses Trust - was
OL,18,Fofficially opened on Friday after a
OL,19,Ftwo-year renovation to convert it from
OL,20,Fa hairdressing salon.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
