OL,3,GNEWSATown gets first new almshouse in
OL,4,A160 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents Linda and Mo Shadafza are due
OL,7,Fto move in by Christmas, with Linda
OL,8,Fsaying the "great benefit is that we
OL,9,Fknow that unless we really misbehave,
OL,10,Fwe can stay here forever if we want to,
OL,11,Fwhich is really comforting".
